            "/leases": {
              "get": {
                "description": "Paginated list of leases. Admin/Manager callers list all leases (or filter by\\n\`userEmail\`); a regular caller may only list their own (\`userEmail\` must be\\ntheir own, else 403 \`AccessDeniedError\`). Each result item carries a \`leaseId\`.\\n\`maxResults\` caps at 2000.",
